      "en": "and behold, a lead cover weighing one talent was lifted up—and there was a woman sitting in the middle of the ephah basket.”",
      "ko": "이 에바 가운데에는 한 여인이 앉았느니라 하는 동시에 둥근 납 한 조각이 들리더라",
      "source_text_hash": "a95aa6bdaf830afaaeecaabd3376199ee2325dfad7264c2314b3d6436872eb45",
      "translation_text_hash": "725f17ea3aceed3a7ca58b6a7ba950f640ef9415f10c4d5492a5f8a91fdb9cb7",
