      "en": "Then I said to the angel who talked with me, “Where are these carrying the ephah basket?”",
      "ko": "내가 내게 말하는 천사에게 묻되 그들이 에바를 어디로 옮겨 가나이까 하매",
      "source_text_hash": "0c68be37a81a800e31ce517a42928518a3c470911795bbc64491a9e63b83d945",
      "translation_text_hash": "5261b514cf416693a037676c8e8ec19ea63fa75d6407c77362ce6869eefa0c1d",
